<Layout title="About" description="Learn what Pickora is for and how we approach product discovery."><div class="wrap page-shell"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'About' }]} /><article class="prose-page"><p class="eyebrow">A clearer way to choose</p><h1>Useful ideas. Honest context.</h1><p class="lead">Pickora is a product discovery publication for people in India who want practical advice before making everyday choices.</p><p>Shopping can involve too many tabs, unclear claims and advice that skips over the trade-offs. We want to make the research easier to follow: explain what to consider, who a choice might suit, and where the limitations are.</p><h2>Our approach</h2><p>We publish original articles and buying guides across a range of useful categories. When we recommend a product, we aim to explain the selection criteria and the intended use. We don’t publish fabricated testing, ratings, prices or customer experiences.</p><p>Some links may earn a commission if you make a qualifying purchase. Affiliate relationships do not determine what we cover. We will identify relevant affiliate links clearly and maintain a separate <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p><h2>A working name</h2><p>Pickora is a working brand name while the project is being prepared. Before launch, its owner should check domain availability, similar businesses and relevant trademarks, and replace the name if needed.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/editorial-policy/">Read our editorial policy <span>↗</span></a></article></div></Layout>
